  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNEP st&#xf6;d 2010-2013</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNEP support 2010-2013 - UNEP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">1 FNs milj&#xf6;program UNEPs strategi f&#xf6;r 2010-2013 ges st&#xf6;d, vilken UNEP genomf&#xf6;r i tv&#xe5; perioder om tv&#xe5; &#xe5;r, med en arbetsplan 2010/11 och en   2012/13. I strategin prioriteras sex tematiska omr&#xe5;den, varav Sida    f&#xf6;resl&#xe5;s st&#xf6;dja fyra: klimat, naturresurshush&#xe5;llning, milj&#xf6;styrning,  farliga &#xe4;mnen och avfall. MSEK 5 ges till PEI &#xe5;ren 2011, 2012, 2013.   Mid Term Review ev 2012</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1, UNITED NATIONS ENVIRONMENT PROGRAMME (UNEP)programme support to    implementation of UNEP&#xb4;s Medium-term Strategy (MTS) 2010-2013         &quot;Environment for development&quot;. 4 of 6 themes supported: climate       change,ecosystem management,environmental governance,harmful          subst/waste MSEK 5 for 2011, 2012 and 2013 shall be allocated to the  Poverty and Environment Initiative (PEI). Mid Term Review 2012?</narrative>
  </description>
